{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01722","headline":"杂曲歌辞 灞上轻薄行 · 孟郊","name":"杂曲歌辞 灞上轻薄行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长安无缓步，况值天景暮。\n相逢灞滻间，亲戚不相顾。\n自叹方拙身，忽随轻薄伦。\n常恐失所避，化爲车辙尘。\n此中生白发，疾走亦未歇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01722.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01722","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}